# Types and the build output both come from outside the repo.
#
# `node_modules` here is a SYMLINK to $DSH_HOME/profiles/node_modules, created
# by `npm run link-types`. That directory is dsh's own shared fallback tree of
# symlinks into the npx cache, re-healed on every launch, so the plugin
# typechecks against the exact package versions the running harness loads —
# and never pins a second copy of them.
node_modules
lib
